# Specs

- `docs/spec/product-spec.md` is the product source of truth.
- `docs/spec/frontend-spec.md` and `docs/spec/backend-spec.md` reuse `R-*` / `SCR-*` / `FLO-*`. Do not add screens.
- Do not invent requirements that contradict `docs/spec/product-spec.md`.
- GDPR / legal is **out of MVP**. Default price is **600 UAH**.
- Do not implement the app while filling specs.
- When writing a layer spec, follow the project skill **write-layer-spec**.
